# BuildKit honours <dockerfile>.dockerignore, so this scopes the build context
# even though the context root is the repository root (the browser client lives
# in top-level web/, outside deploy/).
#
# Exclude everything, then re-include only the two trees the image needs. This
# keeps ~1 GB of game source out of the context, and makes it structurally
# impossible to accidentally bake licensed content into the image.
*
!deploy
!web

# ...and re-exclude local state inside those trees.
deploy/logs
deploy/.env
deploy/**/*.log
web/node_modules

# Belt and braces: never send game assets, whatever the layout.
**/*.big
**/*.BIG
**/*.bik
